commit fcdb20f8f059b86a3ce1fc39bd93c8eed5e8893e
Author: Jonathan Hedley <jonathan@hedley.net>
Date:   Tue Sep 22 16:37:21 2026 +1000

    Align HTML null and initial newline handling with the spec (#2616)

    This removes nulls from body and table text, and replaces them in
    foreign content.

    Also, ignore the initial newline in pre, listing, and textarea, while
    preserving leading text when serializing and reparsing.

diff --git a/src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/Printer.java b/src/main/java/org/jsoup/nodes/Printer.java
index 6b83fdbf..f41f1cc3 100644
